      "CLARESSA: What’s this?\nLUNCH LADY: Your coach came by. Say you need that good protein. Me and the girls made this for you special.\nCLARESSA: At least lemme get some fri-\nLUNCH LADY: Jason say no french fries, no fried chicken. And lay off them Red Vines.",
      "CLARESSA: Zay, wait.\nCLARESSA: Zay.\nCLARESSA: Look -- if this what you want... If this the only reason why you with me --\nZAY CLARESSA: It’s not the only-- Listen to me.",
      "JACKIE: Where you comin’ from?\nCLARESSA: Nowhere.\nJACKIE: Nowhere? Come here for a minute.\nCLARESSA: I’m goin’ to bed, I got training in the morning."
